1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,800
Fold a sheet in half. Again.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,400
Every fold doubles the layers.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,800
64 layers.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,400
The seventh fold will not close.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,600
Unfolded, the sheet keeps a record.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,200
Fold it back and forth instead.

7
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:35,200
Each crease bends one layer, not sixty-four.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,600
One pull and it opens.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,400
Twelve folds took 1,200 metres of paper.

10
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:50,000
Fold smarter, not more.
